#: ../../building.rst:2
msgid "Building from source"
msgstr "从源码构建"

#: ../../building.rst:5
msgid "Running it"
msgstr "运行"

#: ../../building.rst:7
msgid ""
"Orbit needs Python 3.10 or newer and PySide6. Everything else is standard "
"library."
msgstr "Orbit 需要 Python 3.10 或更高版本以及 PySide6，其余全部是标准库。"

#: ../../building.rst:20
msgid "Freezing"
msgstr "打包冻结"

#: ../../building.rst:22
msgid ""
"``build/make_exe.py`` wraps PyInstaller and is the single entry point for "
"both platforms."
msgstr "``build/make_exe.py`` 封装了 PyInstaller，是两个平台唯一的入口脚本。"

#: ../../building.rst:29
msgid ""
"``--no-genomes`` skips the ``*.2bit`` files, so the bundle carries "
"annotation only and sequence comes from UCSC. This is what the installers "
"use."
msgstr "``--no-genomes`` 会跳过 ``*.2bit`` 文件，因此包内只带注释，序列从 UCSC 获取。正式安装包就是这样构建的。"

#: ../../building.rst:31
msgid "``--windowed`` builds a GUI executable with no console window."
msgstr "``--windowed`` 生成不带控制台窗口的图形界面程序。"

#: ../../building.rst:32
msgid ""
"Without either flag you get a console build with local sequence — useful for"
" debugging."
msgstr "两个参数都不加时，得到的是带本地序列的控制台版本 — 便于调试。"

#: ../../building.rst:35
msgid "The script handles the platform differences that PyInstaller does not:"
msgstr "脚本处理了 PyInstaller 本身不处理的平台差异："

#: ../../building.rst:41
msgid "Difference"
msgstr "差异点"

#: ../../building.rst:42
msgid "Handling"
msgstr "处理方式"

#: ../../building.rst:43
msgid "``--add-data`` separator"
msgstr "``--add-data`` 的分隔符"

#: ../../building.rst:44
msgid "``;`` on Windows, ``:`` on macOS"
msgstr "Windows 用 ``;``，macOS 用 ``:``"

#: ../../building.rst:45
msgid "Output layout"
msgstr "输出结构"

#: ../../building.rst:46
msgid "``dist/Orbit/`` on Windows, ``dist/Orbit.app`` on macOS"
msgstr "Windows 为 ``dist/Orbit/``，macOS 为 ``dist/Orbit.app``"

#: ../../building.rst:47
msgid "Data location"
msgstr "数据位置"

#: ../../building.rst:48
msgid ""
"``data/`` next to the executable, which is ``Contents/MacOS`` inside the "
"bundle"
msgstr "``data/`` 位于可执行文件旁，在应用包内即 ``Contents/MacOS``"

#: ../../building.rst:49
msgid "Bundle id"
msgstr "包标识"

#: ../../building.rst:50
msgid "``--osx-bundle-identifier`` is passed on macOS only"
msgstr "仅在 macOS 上传入 ``--osx-bundle-identifier``"

#: ../../building.rst:53
msgid "Windows installer"
msgstr "Windows 安装包"

#: ../../building.rst:55
msgid "Requires `Inno Setup 6 <https://jrsoftware.org/isinfo.php>`_."
msgstr "需要 `Inno Setup 6 <https://jrsoftware.org/isinfo.php>`_。"

#: ../../building.rst:61
msgid ""
"Produces ``dist\\installer\\Orbit-1.0.2-Windows-x64-Setup.exe``. The script "
"is a per-user install (``PrivilegesRequired=lowest``), which avoids the UAC "
"prompt and lets the app write to its own data directory."
msgstr ""
"产物为 "
"``dist\\installer\\Orbit-1.0.2-Windows-x64-Setup.exe``。安装脚本按用户安装（``PrivilegesRequired=lowest``），既能避开"
" UAC 提示，也让应用可以写入自己的数据目录。"

#: ../../building.rst:67
msgid ""
"Inno Setup does not ship a Simplified Chinese language file, so "
"``installer/ChineseSimplified.isl`` is kept in the repository and referenced"
" by a relative path. Without it the compiler fails with *\"Couldn't open "
"include file\"*."
msgstr ""
"Inno Setup 并不自带简体中文语言文件，因此把 ``installer/ChineseSimplified.isl`` "
"一并放进仓库，并用相对路径引用。缺少它时编译器会报 *\"Couldn't open include file\"*。"

#: ../../building.rst:73
msgid "macOS disk image"
msgstr "macOS 磁盘映像"

#: ../../building.rst:79
msgid ""
"The script ad-hoc signs the bundle, clears extended attributes, stages the "
"app with an ``/Applications`` symlink, and calls ``hdiutil``. Ad-hoc signing"
" is not optional: on Apple Silicon an unsigned arm64 binary is killed on "
"launch."
msgstr ""
"脚本会对应用包做临时签名、清除扩展属性、把应用和指向 ``/Applications`` 的符号链接摆好，然后调用 "
"``hdiutil``。临时签名不是可选项：在 Apple Silicon 上，未签名的 arm64 二进制一启动就会被系统杀掉。"

#: ../../building.rst:83
msgid ""
"Shipping without the Gatekeeper warning needs an Apple Developer certificate"
" and a notarization step, neither of which the project has."
msgstr "若想彻底消除 Gatekeeper 提示，需要 Apple 开发者证书和公证流程，本项目两者都不具备。"

#: ../../building.rst:87
msgid "Continuous integration"
msgstr "持续集成"

#: ../../building.rst:89
msgid ""
"``.github/workflows/build.yml`` builds all three packages on every tag."
msgstr "``.github/workflows/build.yml`` 会在每次打 tag 时构建全部三个安装包。"

#: ../../building.rst:95
msgid "Job"
msgstr "任务"

#: ../../building.rst:96
msgid "Runner"
msgstr "运行器"

#: ../../building.rst:97
msgid "Produces"
msgstr "产物"

#: ../../building.rst:98
msgid "Windows-x64"
msgstr "Windows-x64"

#: ../../building.rst:99
msgid "``windows-latest``"
msgstr "``windows-latest``"

#: ../../building.rst:100
msgid "Inno Setup installer"
msgstr "Inno Setup 安装程序"

#: ../../building.rst:101
msgid "macOS-arm64"
msgstr "macOS-arm64"

#: ../../building.rst:102
msgid "``macos-15``"
msgstr "``macos-15``"

#: ../../building.rst:103
msgid "arm64 disk image"
msgstr "arm64 磁盘映像"

#: ../../building.rst:104
msgid "macOS-x64"
msgstr "macOS-x64"

#: ../../building.rst:105
msgid "``macos-15-intel``"
msgstr "``macos-15-intel``"

#: ../../building.rst:106
msgid "Intel disk image"
msgstr "Intel 磁盘映像"

#: ../../building.rst:107
msgid "Publish release"
msgstr "发布 Release"

#: ../../building.rst:108
msgid "``ubuntu-latest``"
msgstr "``ubuntu-latest``"

#: ../../building.rst:109
msgid "Collects all three and attaches them to the release"
msgstr "汇总三个产物并附加到 Release 上"

#: ../../building.rst:111
msgid ""
"The release step is a separate job on purpose. Running it inside the matrix "
"means three jobs publish concurrently, which duplicates the release notes "
"and races on the same assets."
msgstr "发布步骤特意拆成独立任务。若放在矩阵内部，三个任务会同时发布，导致发布说明重复、并互相争抢同一批资产。"

#: ../../building.rst:117
msgid ""
"Runner labels are easy to get wrong. ``macos-15`` is Apple Silicon, "
"``macos-15-intel`` is Intel, and ``macos-15-arm64`` is not a label at all — "
"a job using it queues forever."
msgstr ""
"运行器标签很容易搞错。``macos-15`` 是 Apple Silicon，``macos-15-intel`` 是 Intel，而 "
"``macos-15-arm64`` 根本不是标签 — 用它写的任务会永远排队。"

#: ../../building.rst:122
msgid "Releasing"
msgstr "发版"

#: ../../building.rst:129
msgid ""
"The tag push triggers the build and attaches the three packages to a new "
"release. Nothing is published for ordinary pushes to ``main``."
msgstr "推送 tag 会触发构建，并把三个安装包附加到新的 Release 上。普通推送到 ``main`` 不会发布任何东西。"

#: ../../building.rst:133
msgid "Building the documentation"
msgstr "构建文档"

#: ../../building.rst:140
msgid ""
"The English build is the source; Chinese comes from the gettext catalogues "
"in ``docs/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES``."
msgstr "英文构建是源语言；中文来自 ``docs/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES`` 下的 gettext 目录。"

#: ../../building.rst:143
msgid "To refresh the catalogues after editing a page:"
msgstr "修改页面后，刷新目录文件："

#: ../../building.rst:150
msgid ""
"Then translate the new ``msgid`` entries and rebuild with ``-D "
"language=zh_CN``."
msgstr "然后翻译新增的 ``msgid`` 条目，并用 ``-D language=zh_CN`` 重新构建。"
